@startuml component-diagram
' Static view — component diagram of ПДн Контроль (MVP v2).
' Rendered without Graphviz via PlantUML's built-in Smetana layout engine.
!pragma layout smetana
title ПДн Контроль — Component Diagram (Static View, MVP v2)

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

actor "Business owner\n(browser)" as User

node "Customer host (Docker Compose)" {
  [Caddy\nTLS reverse proxy] as Caddy
  [Frontend SPA\nReact + Vite / nginx] as FE
  [Backend API\nFastAPI / uvicorn] as API
  [Celery Worker\nscan pipeline] as Worker
  [Crowler / Parser\nFastAPI + Chromium] as Crawler
  [PDF Report\nFastAPI + Typst] as PDF
  database "PostgreSQL\nscans, users" as DB
  queue "Redis\nbroker · result · LLM cache · progress" as Redis
}

cloud "External systems" {
  [Scanned target site] as Target
  [LLM API (Qwen)] as LLM
  [GeoIP] as GeoIP
  [OAuth: Yandex / VK] as OAuth
  [E-mail provider] as Email
  [CloudPayments] as Pay
}

User --> Caddy : HTTPS :443
Caddy --> FE : static SPA
Caddy --> API : /api/* (reverse proxy)

API --> DB : SQLAlchemy (asyncpg)
API --> Redis : enqueue scan · read progress
API --> OAuth : OAuth2 redirect flow
API --> Email : send OTP / notifications (SMTP/API)
API --> Pay : checkout
API --> PDF : POST unified report JSON\n→ receive PDF (HTTP)

Worker --> Redis : consume queue · LLM cache · progress
Worker --> DB : write Scan.report_json (psycopg2)
Worker --> Crawler : POST /scan (HTTP)
Worker --> LLM : analyze policy texts (HTTPS)
Worker --> GeoIP : resolve server country

Crawler --> Target : crawl public pages (HTTP/HTTPS)

@enduml
